# Production matchmaking backend. Intentionally unset here: Vite bakes
# VITE_MATCHMAKING_URL into the bundle at build time, so the URL must come
# from the build environment (Cloudflare Pages project env vars, CI, or an
# explicit local export) — never from a committed file. See .env.example and
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md. Production builds without the variable fail loudly in
# src/lib/matchmaking.ts instead of silently pointing at a stale backend.
# Local override (untracked, see .gitignore):
# VITE_MATCHMAKING_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
